1
00:06:07,058 --> 00:06:13,058
Good Kill is a drama, thriller, war film directed by Andrew Niccol.

2
00:12:14,117 --> 00:12:20,117
In the shadowy world of drone warfare, combat unfolds like a
video game–only with real lives at stake.

3
00:18:21,176 --> 00:18:27,176
After six tours of duty, Air Force pilot Tom Egan now fights the
Taliban from an air-conditioned bunker in the Nevada desert.

4
00:24:28,235 --> 00:24:34,235
But as he yearns to get back in the cockpit of a real plane and becomes increasingly troubled by the collateral damage he
causes each time he pushes a button, Egan’s nerves—and his relationship with his wife—begin to unravel.

5
00:30:35,294 --> 00:30:41,294
Commandant Tom Egan, played by Ethan Hawke.

6
00:36:42,352 --> 00:36:48,352
Molly Egan, played by January Jones.

7
00:42:49,411 --> 00:42:55,411
Airman Vera Suarez, played by Zoë Kravitz.

8
00:48:56,470 --> 00:49:02,470
M.I.C. Joseph Zimmer, played by Jake Abel.

9
00:55:03,529 --> 00:55:09,529
Lieutenant Colonel Jack Johns, played by Bruce Greenwood.

10
01:01:10,588 --> 01:01:16,588
Emily James, played by Alma Sisneros.

11
01:07:17,647 --> 01:07:23,647
Good Kill is a 2014 American drama film written and directed by Andrew Niccol.

12
01:13:24,705 --> 01:13:30,705
The film stars Ethan Hawke, Bruce Greenwood, Zoë
Kravitz, Jake Abel, and January Jones.

13
01:19:31,764 --> 01:19:37,764
It competed for the Golden Lion at the 71st Venice International Film Festival.

14
01:25:38,823 --> 01:25:44,823
It was also screened in the Special Presentations section of
the 2014 Toronto International Film Festival.

15
01:31:45,882 --> 01:31:51,882
The film explores themes of suspicion, pilot,
drone, us military, air force base.

16
01:37:52,941 --> 01:37:58,941
The tone is emotional and intense.
